   $q$Which question about the project does the passage leave unanswered?$q$, $q$[{"text":"How much the volunteers' work improved search results for issues before 1880.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Why the software sometimes mistook one letter of old type for another.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"stated-in-text"},{"text":"How long the library needed to photograph its full collection of volumes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"stated-in-text"},{"text":"How many volunteers took part in correcting text during the first year.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"stated-in-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$How much the volunteers' work improved search results for issues before 1880.$q$, $q$The passage reports how many articles were corrected but never says how many were from before 1880 or how much searching improved, so that effect is unknown. The reason for misread letters is given: the software read a long s as an f.$q$, 'draft', '914ee808-4690-58a9-b0a8-2131e39903e0')
