   $q$According to the passage, under what conditions did most tagged gliders travel?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Every day without rest until they reached their breeding grounds.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Only at night, when receivers on towers could detect them best.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"On days after a cold front had passed, with winds from the north.","is_correct":true},{"text":"On calm, warm days before a cold front arrived from the south.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$On days after a cold front had passed, with winds from the north.$q$, $q$The third paragraph says most traveled "only on days after a cold front had passed, when winds blew from the north." The text also says they did not fly every day, which rules out continuous travel.$q$, 'draft', '2e1a92dc-63ae-5d19-8a5f-48f18cf020e7')
