   $q$What does the narrator reveal in the very first paragraph?$q$, $q$[{"text":"That the team finished the race in last place","is_correct":true},{"text":"That the team quit rowing after the first season","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"That the team's boat sank before the finish line","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"That the team won the race by eleven seconds","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$That the team finished the race in last place$q$, $q$The story opens, "We finished last, by eleven seconds," and the narrator says this is where the story ends. The eleven seconds measure how far behind they were, not a winning margin.$q$, 'draft', '9617c6e6-cebe-592a-a2d3-06d729b873aa')
