  ('ec1691ee-6dbf-5626-90cd-accd3154b7af', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-literary-structure-pov'), null, 'hard',
   $q$The story begins and ends with the team finishing last. How does this structure shape the meaning of the resolution?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The return to the loss corrects it, so the reader learns the team actually placed higher than reported.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The return to the loss repeats it, so the story ends as a tragedy about wasted months of effort.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-shift"},{"text":"The return to the loss hurries it, so the coach's question feels unrelated to the rest of the story.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"},{"text":"The return to the loss reframes it, so a defeat on the scoreboard becomes a quietly triumphant ending.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The return to the loss reframes it, so a defeat on the scoreboard becomes a quietly triumphant ending.$q$, $q$The same fact frames both ends, but by the close the reader knows about the moment of perfect rhythm, so "last" no longer means failure. The coach "did not mention the time," which shows the ending is about what was gained, not wasted.$q$, 'draft', '9617c6e6-cebe-592a-a2d3-06d729b873aa')
