   $q$What does the heron spend the summer doing instead of fishing?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Building a nest of bark along the bend of the river","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Teaching the kingfisher a better way to catch its fish","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Searching the deep water for the very largest fish","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Recording detailed information about every fish that passes","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Recording detailed information about every fish that passes$q$, $q$The heron keeps a ledger of the fishes' sizes, speeds and habits all summer and plans to fish only afterward. The bark is used for the ledger, not a nest.$q$, 'draft', '1f423d1b-86a2-5d31-bb69-326e28f42f48')
