   $q$Why does the poet describe a school project with grand phrases such as "Hear now" and "Four heroes"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The heroic style shows that the project was truly dangerous and difficult.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"takes-speaker-literally"},{"text":"The heroic style proves that all four students worked equally hard together.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The heroic style clashes with an ordinary subject, which mocks the group's behavior.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The heroic style signals that the poem is set in an ancient time period.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The heroic style clashes with an ordinary subject, which mocks the group's behavior.$q$, $q$Epic language applied to pretzels and a color-coded schedule creates comic contrast that exposes the unequal effort. Priya does "everything," so the students did not work equally.$q$, 'draft', 'ba6346df-0ea0-5d96-88cf-18925cb69cdd')
