   $q$Why is it ironic that the teammates sleep "the deep and peaceful sleep of the deserving"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They are far from the library, so they do not know that the project is due tomorrow.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-irony"},{"text":"They have done almost nothing, so they deserve the rest least of anyone in the poem.","is_correct":true},{"text":"They have worked all night, so the speaker sincerely praises their hard-earned rest.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"takes-speaker-literally"},{"text":"They are worried about the grade, so their sleep is actually restless and troubled.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They have done almost nothing, so they deserve the rest least of anyone in the poem.$q$, $q$While Priya does all the work, the others sleep, so calling their sleep "deserving" says the opposite of the truth. Only Priya works through the night; the teammates did not.$q$, 'draft', 'ba6346df-0ea0-5d96-88cf-18925cb69cdd')
