   $q$What causes the town's misunderstanding?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A band that canceled its visit at the very last minute","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"A banner on Main Street that was painted with a mistake","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"A word dropped from the telegram while it was being copied","is_correct":true},{"text":"A joke that Mr. Okonkwo played on the people of the town","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A word dropped from the telegram while it was being copied$q$, $q$Odalys sneezes while copying, and "the word SAW never reached the paper," so the message seems to announce a band. The banner was a result of the mistake, not its cause.$q$, 'draft', 'e6cfc567-cd22-59c1-bc46-50a863751977')
