   $q$What does Mrs. Halvorsen's instruction to "Type exactly what is on the page" suggest about her view of the historian's job?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She wants Dev to work faster and stop reading the entries closely.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She thinks Dev's theory is certainly wrong and should be dropped.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstated-inference"},{"text":"She wants the record kept accurate so later readers can judge for themselves.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She believes old ledgers are too unreliable to be worth keeping.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She wants the record kept accurate so later readers can judge for themselves.$q$, $q$She says "Whoever reads this later can argue about it," so she separates faithful recording from interpretation. She says "Maybe" to Dev's idea, so she does not reject it outright.$q$, 'draft', 'ec3b98c9-71ed-544e-9759-eba25dd6a1df')
