  ('22cb9ce0-6c34-50d1-9550-3ded033bcb95', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-story-details-inference'), null, 'medium',
   $q$At the end, Felix is typing a long message while smiling. Who is the most likely recipient, based on the text?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Amara's family, to praise her careful work that morning.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"A scientist in South America who tracks the same warbler.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Dr. Kowalczyk, to tell her that a bird she banded returned.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The station's new volunteers, to cancel the next session.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Dr. Kowalczyk, to tell her that a bird she banded returned.$q$, $q$The bird carries her initials, Felix speaks of her constantly, and he says "The way she would," so news of her bird would most likely go to her. The text never names the recipient, but nothing points to Amara's family.$q$, 'draft', 'fd3f5dd4-461b-5acd-94af-e352d8c76197')
