   $q$The final sentence returns to the number 79 from the opening. Which statement best evaluates this structural choice?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It is mainly decorative and has no connection to the call to action in the same paragraph.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-connection"},{"text":"It introduces a new measurement that proves the pilot did not lower roof temperatures.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"It frames the argument, linking the call to action back to the vivid opening so the stakes of inaction feel memorable.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It is ineffective, because repeating a number suggests the author has run out of evidence.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It frames the argument, linking the call to action back to the vivid opening so the stakes of inaction feel memorable.$q$, $q$By echoing the 79 degree reading, the ending ties the vote to the problem that opened the piece and warns what waiting will cost. It is the same reading, not new evidence, and it directly supports the call to vote yes.$q$, 'draft', 'ed98755c-e69f-54ac-a211-c5acb5753535')
