  ('f09393d8-42a3-598c-a25d-acaaf3d55950', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-theme-summary'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Simone gets a cramp on the trail and later shares half of an orange at the water table.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Priya makes a terrible mistake by giving up her chance at the state meet for a rival.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"Priya, close to her goal time, stops to help her struggling rival finish, misses the time, and records the shared mile in her log.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Priya and Simone tie for first place and both qualify for the state meet.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Priya, close to her goal time, stops to help her struggling rival finish, misses the time, and records the shared mile in her log.$q$, $q$The correct choice covers Priya's goal, her decision, the result, and her log entry without judging her. Calling the choice "a terrible mistake" is an opinion, and the clock shows 19:12, slower than 18:40.$q$, 'draft', '84cd6bc4-cabe-557e-b99a-2929b048090e')
