  ('58106c4e-5eea-5b33-80b5-1f08239169d9', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-theme-summary'), null, 'hard',
   $q$How does the final catalog entry develop the theme further than the rest of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Naming E.M. as creator changes who is credited in the record, while \"identity unknown\" admits how much of ordinary lives is already lost.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It suggests the mill company was hiding E.M.'s identity on purpose.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It shows that Dae-jung cares more about finishing quickly than about accuracy.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It shows that Dae-jung has made an error, since only the company can legally be a creator.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Naming E.M. as creator changes who is credited in the record, while "identity unknown" admits how much of ordinary lives is already lost.$q$, $q$Every earlier record named the company, so typing E.M. gives a worker credit, and "identity unknown" shows the limits of that recovery. Nothing in the passage suggests the company deliberately hid the weaver's name.$q$, 'draft', 'd3f6bc26-2ac5-5558-9e14-0c71661a3691')
